\section{Scope}{

\itemize{
\item Experimental. Exported names may still change.
\item Sequential execution; there is no parallel backend.
\item No preprocessing, registration, masking, or hemodynamic response
modeling. Bring fitted effects, or scan responses with a design.
\item Within-participant results only. There is no group-inference path.
\item Crossvalidated estimates are retained when negative; they are not clipped.
\item Uncertainty is refused rather than approximated when the fit cannot
support the admitted analytic law.
}
